  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Spring into savings with 10% off 🏖️<br><br>Welcome to your perfect Sandestin getaway! This beautifully appointed 4-bedroom, 4-bath home offers comfort, privacy, and space for families or groups traveling together making it easy for everyone to relax and unwind. Located in the heart of Sandestin Golf and Beach Resort, this home puts you close to it all—sugar-white beaches, championship golf courses, tennis courts, pools, marina, and The Village of Baytowne Wharf with dining, shopping, and entertainment 🌴🌊🌞<br><br>Our beach home is a four-bedroom, four-bathroom that accommodates up to ten guests with ease, offering an unparalleled blend of coastal charm and comfort. Explore the resort in style with your very complimentary six-seater and four-seater golf carts, ensuring effortless access to beaches, dining, and entertainment. It`s a quick yet 8 minute serene drive to the beach. You never have to leave the resort as an underground tunnel makes getting to the beach a breeze especially with easy beachside parking. <br><br>Inside, bright décor create a serene yet inviting atmosphere. The open living and dining areas provide ample seating for relaxation or gathering over a meal, while the fully equipped gourmet kitchen has everything needed to craft memorable culinary experiences.<br><br>The first guest bedroom on the main floor features a queen bed. Upstairs, the master suite boasts a king bed, flat-screen TV, and spa-like ensuite with walk-in shower and double vanity. Two additional guest bedrooms are on the second floor plus a bonus space that offers two twin beds. <br><br>Outside, enjoy cooking dinner on our gas grill while listening to the fountain behind our property. Enjoy two lightweight chairs, one umbrella, and a pool/beach towel for every guest during your stay. Beach chair rentals are available from the resort vendor for an additional fee.<br><br>Enjoy a variety of amenities during your stay:<br>• Poolside Relaxation – Enjoy access to three sparkling resort pools: the Phil Hummel Aquatic Center, the Linkside Pool, and the Villa Lago community pool.<br>• Active Adventures – Golf, tennis, and full fitness center access are available for an additional fee.<br>• Endless Scenery – Explore seven miles of sugar-white sand beach plus miles of walking and biking trails across the 2,400-acre resort.<br><br>Nearby points of interest:<br>• The Village of Baytowne Wharf – Stroll through a vibrant bayside village filled with dining, shopping, and family-friendly entertainment.<br>• Grand Boulevard – Explore upscale boutiques, fine dining, and a luxury movie theater, all in an open-air setting.<br>• Silver Sands Outlet Mall – Shop designer brands at one of the nation’s largest premium outlet centers.<br><br>*PARKING FOR 2 VEHICLES ONLY!*<br>* NO SMOKING/NO PETS<br>* Renter must be at least 25 years of age.<br>* For insurance and liability purposes, a copy of a valid driver’s license is required for any guest who intends to operate the golf cart during their stay. This documentation is used solely to verify driving eligibility and meet insurance requirements. In the event of damage, an accident, or a rule violation involving the golf cart, the information provided may be used for claims or recovery purposes. Otherwise, it will not be shared or retained beyond the reservation period.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
